Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Separate data folder (GBSERVER_DATA_DIR), proxy trust
 toggle, supervisor shutdown hook

- ROMs, saves, blocked_ips.json and offline.flag live under DATA_DIR
  (defaults to the code folder, so the Pi layout is unchanged)
- GBSERVER_BEHIND_PROXY=0 stops trusting X-Forwarded-* when serving directly
- supervisor_hooks: token-protected graceful save-and-exit endpoint, only
  registered when GBSERVER_SUPERVISOR_TOKEN is set
